Fix compatibility with recent pydantic versions (tested up to pydantic 2.14).

- Since pydantic 2.11, the computation of the type references used into the
  core schema has been moved from ``pydantic._internal._generate_schema.get_type_ref``
  to ``pydantic._internal._type_refs.model_type_ref``. The patch ensuring the
  uniqueness of the type reference of each extendable model now targets the
  right function according to the installed pydantic version.
- Stop using the deprecated ``FieldInfo.merge_field_infos`` method when
  available (pydantic >= 2.12).
- Fix a deprecation warning with python 3.14 when resolving PEP-604 unions
  (``typing._UnionGenericAlias`` is deprecated).
